acceptance_criteria: Failed replacement restores prior files and exact managed/settings bytes; prior commands work in a fresh process; failures report previous_state_preserved and actionable recovery; successful and fresh installs retain their contracts
parent: pm-ugqx
risk: medium
confidence: high
expected_result: "A rejected copied package replacement restores the prior package and managed/settings content, keeps the previous command available, and reports executable recovery if restoration fails."
