comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-22T10:16:01.200Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: strict full all-status read of 3058 items completed with zero unreadable records and no omissions. Request-specific search and full live canonical history reads found completed adjacent work but no owner for this newly reported boundary. Reuse the existing capability lineage and retain prior closures."
  "2026-10-22T10:23:18.105Z","harness:codex","Regression sensitivity on unchanged main ec2e9db8f in an isolated worktree: all four replacement keepers fail, including activation, load and disabled-host rejection plus rollback failure recovery. Prior persistence snapshot ended before runtime probing. Extend the same install lock and snapshot through probing and contribution persistence, preserving the fresh-install diagnostic contract. Exact tree/settings/managed bytes and fresh-process prior-command execution are acceptance."
  "2026-10-22T10:58:19.916Z","harness:codex","Full local execution: 11016 tests passed and four checks failed (test directory fan-out, 451-line docs limit, additive SDK error-code snapshot drift, and this host npm module discovery). Corrected the new test placement, retained the focused lifecycle documentation, refreshed the additive public error catalog snapshot, and reran the packed fixture with the installed npm package exposed through NODE_PATH. No coverage threshold or source denominator changed. The failed run emitted no coverage summary; final exact coverage still requires authoritative hosted proof."
  "2026-10-22T11:09:36.073Z","harness:codex",The final public result preserves both thrown persistence failures and returned verification failures. Recovery backups are retained only when restoration fails and remain under ignored runtime storage; the executable recovery command is exercised. Exact original enablement is restored through an audited workspace-history compensation and verified by the history-state checker. In-place failures explicitly decline to claim an earlier recoverable version. Public SDK and CLI error catalogs are regenerated for extension_install_rollback_failed.
